      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long tells Fairy Zi Wei that the first four planned time path Immortal Gu Houses are acceptable, but the core Immortal Gu of the fifth, Moment Stage, is the Immortal Gu in Million Heavenly King Gallery. Fairy Zi Wei calls this the most stable plan among the ones she deduced, and Duke Long agrees to go with it.",
      "chapters": [
        1795
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "path_time",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "house_moment_stage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To construct Moment Stage, Fairy Zi Wei takes out the core Immortal Gu of Million Heavenly King Gallery in Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1833
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-gu-removal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Over a million years earlier, Reckless Savage Demon Venerable invaded Heavenly Court and stormed through it, passing Million Heavenly King Gallery after Eternal Sand Cave and before Embroidered Tower, Central Great Hall, and Heaven Overseeing Tower.",
